Description: Upgrade the old V4L2 source to the native SPA module
 The standalone package required the exact stock PipeWire version. Replace it
 with an empty transitional package so APT can upgrade the full package set.
 The repaired module now belongs to libspa-0.2-modules; newer versions also
 satisfy the transition.
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -504,3 +504,12 @@
  .
  This is a transitional package for libspa-0.2-libcamera.
  It can safely be removed.
+
+Package: pipewire-v4l2-source
+Section: oldlibs
+Architecture: all
+Depends: libspa-0.2-modules (>= ${binary:Version}),
+         ${misc:Depends}
+Description: transitional package for libspa-0.2-modules
+ The V4L2 source is provided by libspa-0.2-modules.
+ This package can safely be removed.
